  "name": "Dot.Finance VaultPinkBNB getReward charges fee on donated CAKE and mints PINK",
  "summary": "VaultPinkBNB.getReward() took the vault's whole CAKE balance as the caller's profit, sent the performance fee to the PINK minter, which minted 7,000 PINK per BNB of fee, and paid the rest to the caller. With a tiny stake, the attacker repeatedly donated flash-swapped CAKE to the vault, called getReward to recover 70% of it plus freshly minted PINK, and sold the PINK into the PINK/WBNB pair.",
